tps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859220/extras/f71fed7315f3ed0cb37a72c2d0dd8639.poster.avif?t=1742977997\" width=640 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859220/extras/f71fed7315f3ed0cb37a72c2d0dd8639.webm?t=1742977997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859220/extras/f71fed7315f3ed0cb37a72c2d0dd8639.mp4?t=1742977997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join one (or more) of the city's factions and help them fulfill their unique objectives. But beware, as some of them are enemies and don't take kindly to treason. Each faction has a variety of procedural missions that are specific to it, and will have you following clues and interacting with the city environment to complete them. And of course each one comes with a unique set of rewards for rising through its ranks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STAY TUNED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development and more info will be added as it progresses.</p>",
